          "also": [
            "http://mongodb.github.io/mongo-scala-driver/2.1/reference/observables/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Calling `toFuture()` implicitly subscribes and collects emitted items; for a large document result set this can consume significant memory, so the guide recommends callbacks or lambdas. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/languages/scala/scala-driver/current/crud/query/observables.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:023c3f0aa5d22296594166429d411fef624bcccc06dd90eae4ae2e4c4f3aad92",
